    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Search for a &quot;</strong>Primordial Relic<strong>&quot; that's at the bottom of an abandoned ore mine. The mine is infested with giant ants, who have a leader - a mutant titan who doesn't like visitors. Good luck.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the Mine</strong> <strong>in Your Minecart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/6dafedec96838fcb9e3f956cc5828f27.poster.avif?t=1752515713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/6dafedec96838fcb9e3f956cc5828f27.webm?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/6dafedec96838fcb9e3f956cc5828f27.mp4?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a motorized minecart to travel through the mine. Going fast makes a lot of noise and you run the risk of making a wrong turn...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Outsmart or Abuse the Ants</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/2fbeb0e05fe1bd180019270728cffa07.poster.avif?t=1752515713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/2fbeb0e05fe1bd180019270728cffa07.webm?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/2fbeb0e05fe1bd180019270728cffa07.mp4?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ants will use various paths within caves to access and mine the gems. Figure out a way to stop them so you can mine the gems yourself.. or use dynamite. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade the Minecart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/11a6be70013e1c023593b8edf0949f05.poster.avif?t=1752515713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/11a6be70013e1c023593b8edf0949f05.webm?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/11a6be70013e1c023593b8edf0949f05.mp4?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the gems to fuel the minecart booster or visit the <i>Merchant </i>to buy items and upgrades<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Defeat Antodon in the Ultimate Minecart Chase</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/9ce0ba8c277852f494b3c0645ef1d8e0.poster.avif?t=1752515713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/9ce0ba8c277852f494b3c0645ef1d8e0.webm?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/9ce0ba8c277852f494b3c0645ef1d8e0.mp4?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll need the upgrades because Antodon has his own minecart powered by pure ancient evil and he will not stop until you are derailed.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Search for a &quot;</strong>Primordial Relic<strong>&quot; that's at the bottom of an abandoned ore mine. The mine is infested with giant ants, who have a leader - a mutant titan who doesn't like visitors. Good luck.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the Mine</strong> <strong>in Your Minecart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/6dafedec96838fcb9e3f956cc5828f27.poster.avif?t=1752515713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/6dafedec96838fcb9e3f956cc5828f27.webm?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/6dafedec96838fcb9e3f956cc5828f27.mp4?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a motorized minecart to travel through the mine. Going fast makes a lot of noise and you run the risk of making a wrong turn...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Outsmart or Abuse the Ants</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/2fbeb0e05fe1bd180019270728cffa07.poster.avif?t=1752515713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/2fbeb0e05fe1bd180019270728cffa07.webm?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/2fbeb0e05fe1bd180019270728cffa07.mp4?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ants will use various paths within caves to access and mine the gems. Figure out a way to stop them so you can mine the gems yourself.. or use dynamite. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade the Minecart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/11a6be70013e1c023593b8edf0949f05.poster.avif?t=1752515713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/11a6be70013e1c023593b8edf0949f05.webm?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/11a6be70013e1c023593b8edf0949f05.mp4?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the gems to fuel the minecart booster or visit the <i>Merchant </i>to buy items and upgrades<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Defeat Antodon in the Ultimate Minecart Chase</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/9ce0ba8c277852f494b3c0645ef1d8e0.poster.avif?t=1752515713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/9ce0ba8c277852f494b3c0645ef1d8e0.webm?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046590/extras/9ce0ba8c277852f494b3c0645ef1d8e0.mp4?t=1752515713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll need the upgrades because Antodon has his own minecart powered by pure ancient evil and he will not stop until you are derailed.</p>",
